---@class cloudflare.dns.RecordsListRequestComment
---@field absent? string If this parameter is present, only records *without* a comment are returned.
---@field contains? string Substring of the DNS record comment. Comment filters are case-insensitive.
---@field endswith? string Suffix of the DNS record comment. Comment filters are case-insensitive.
---@field exact? string Exact value of the DNS record comment. Comment filters are case-insensitive.
---@field present? string If this parameter is present, only records *with* a comment are returned.
---@field startswith? string Prefix of the DNS record comment. Comment filters are case-insensitive.

---@class cloudflare.dns.RecordsListRequestContent
---@field contains? string Substring of the DNS record content. Content filters are case-insensitive.
---@field endswith? string Suffix of the DNS record content. Content filters are case-insensitive.
---@field exact? string Exact value of the DNS record content. Content filters are case-insensitive.
---@field startswith? string Prefix of the DNS record content. Content filters are case-insensitive.

---@alias cloudflare.dns.RecordsListRequestMatch "any"|"all"

---@class cloudflare.dns.RecordsListRequestName
---@field contains? string Substring of the DNS record name. Name filters are case-insensitive.
---@field endswith? string Suffix of the DNS record name. Name filters are case-insensitive.
---@field exact? string Exact value of the DNS record name. Name filters are case-insensitive.
---@field startswith? string Prefix of the DNS record name. Name filters are case-insensitive.

---@alias cloudflare.dns.RecordsListRequestOrder "type"|"name"|"content"|"ttl"|"proxied"

---@class cloudflare.dns.RecordsListRequestTag
---@field absent? string Name of a tag which must *not* be present on the DNS record. Tag filters are case-insensitive.
---@field contains? string A tag and value, of the form `&lt;tag-name&gt;:&lt;tag-value&gt;`. The API will only return DNS records that have a tag named `&lt;tag-name&gt;` whose value contains `&lt;tag-value&gt;`. Tag filters are case-insensitive.
---@field endswith? string A tag and value, of the form `&lt;tag-name&gt;:&lt;tag-value&gt;`. The API will only return DNS records that have a tag named `&lt;tag-name&gt;` whose value ends with `&lt;tag-value&gt;`. Tag filters are case-insensitive.
---@field exact? string A tag and value, of the form `&lt;tag-name&gt;:&lt;tag-value&gt;`. The API will only return DNS records that have a tag named `&lt;tag-name&gt;` whose value is `&lt;tag-value&gt;`. Tag filters are case-insensitive.
---@field present? string Name of a tag which must be present on the DNS record. Tag filters are case-insensitive.
